---
layout: base.njk
title: Feeds
dek: Open feeds for every section. No account, no algorithm deciding what you see.
permalink: /rss/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="shell page">

  <div class="hero">
    <div>
      <div class="chip">Feeds</div>
      <h1 class="hero__title">Read us anywhere, on your terms</h1>
      <p class="hero__dek">Every feed below is open and complete — full deks, no truncation, no tracking pixels. Paste a URL into any reader.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rail" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rail__stack">
        <div class="rail__label">Open by default</div>
        <div class="rail__line"></div>
        <div class="rail__sub">No account needed</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rail__word">feeds</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cols">
    <div class="cols__main">
      <h2 class="rule-head">Available feeds</h2>
      <div class="defs">
        <div class="defs__item">
          <div class="defs__name">Everything</div>
          <div class="defs__what">{{ site.url }}/feed.xml</div>
        </div>
        {% for s in sections %}
        <div class="defs__item">
          <div class="defs__name">{{ s }}</div>
          <div class="defs__what">{{ site.url }}/{{ s | slugify }}/feed.xml</div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,3.2vw,44px)">
        <h2>Republishing</h2>
        <p>Classrooms, libraries, and other Pacific newsrooms may republish our reporting with attribution and a link. Commercial republication needs a note to <a href="mailto:newsroom@voxmeridian.online">newsroom@voxmeridian.online</a> first — usually a formality.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="cols__aside">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="kicker kicker--light" style="margin-bottom:12px">New to feeds?</div>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-dark-bg);margin-bottom:18px">A reader app checks these addresses for you and shows new stories in order. Nothing ranks them, nothing is hidden, and we learn nothing about you.</p>
        <a href="/subscribe/" class="btn btn--light">Or take the email brief</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

</div>
